gias especiales cuando hay combinaciones…","Calendario cósmico con lunas llenas y nuevas calculadas en tiempo real con signo zodiacal, eclipses 2025-2026, lluvias de meteoros anuales y superlunas. Cada evento es expandible con descripción completa, visibilidad y…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Belen-Humbert/soy-la-luna-app/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"cd6d25fa85d3c5f8899ceb9a75e970e1c7a0e4d974500f0b85849b32182be85b","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:56.666Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:56.666Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"App web progresiva (PWA) de astrología y bienestar. Muestra la fase lunar del día, arcano diario del Tarot Rider-Waite, rituales energéticos y eventos astronómicos. Construida con React, Vite, Tailwind y Supabase.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Belen-Humbert/soy-la-luna-app/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"cd6d25fa85d3c5f8899ceb9a75e970e1c7a0e4d974500f0b85849b32182be85b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Belen-Humbert/soy-la-luna-app/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:56.666Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-05-20T21:43:01Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Belen-Humbert/soy-la-luna-app/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:56.667Z","hash":"cd6d25fa85d3c5f8899ceb9a75e970e1c7a0e4d974500f0b85849b32182be85b","originalBytes":7268,"storedBytes":7268,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["con","del","supabase","vite","tarot","fase","key","lunar","nasa","cada","luna","pwa","rituales","arcano","card","diario","por","api","apod","contrase","date","datos","eventos","google","historial","history","user","agregar","anon","app","arcanos","astrolog","astron","astronom","autom","bash","carta","cient","create","cruzados","default","deploy","descripci","email","energ","entorno","ficos","hook","incluye","inicio","los","notificaciones","null","react","real","rider-waite","seg","svg","url","usuaria","uuid","variable